@startuml 
title MileStone - Add Calendar Event (User Story #2)
legend top
    <b>User Story - GitHub Issue #2</b>

    As a graduate student, I want to add deadlines and events
    to a monthly or weekly calendar so that I can see what's
    due and plan my thesis work around it.
endlegend

actor "Graduate Student" as Student
participant "Schedule Planner UI" as UI
participant "Express API" as API
participant "Prisma ORM" as Prisma
database "MySQL / TiDB" as DB

note over UI, DB
    Sprint 2 calendar event integration (PR #19).
    Authentication uses a sid session cookie.
    sessionToUser resolves the session to a user.
    requireAuth checks the resolved user.
end note

Student -> UI: Enter event or deadline details
Student -> UI: Click Add Event

UI -> UI: Validate event information

alt Valid event
    UI -> API: POST /api/events (event details)

    API -> API: Read sid session cookie (sessionToUser)
    API -> API: Resolve session to user (getUserId)
    API -> API: Authorize request (requireAuth)

    alt Missing or invalid session
        API --> UI: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
        UI --> Student: Display authentication error
    else Valid user
        API -> API: Validate event data

        alt Invalid event data
            API --> UI: HTTP 400 Bad Request
            UI --> Student: Display validation errors
        else Valid event data
            API -> Prisma: calendarEvent.create({ data: eventData })
            Prisma -> DB: INSERT CalendarEvent
            DB --> Prisma: Event saved
            Prisma --> API: Created event

            API --> UI: HTTP 201 Created
            UI -> UI: Refresh calendar
            UI --> Student: Display saved event
        end
    end

else Invalid event
    UI --> Student: Display validation errors
end

@enduml